This work distributes no third-party code. verify_bundle.py runs on the Python
standard library alone; the optional decryption paths import `cryptography` and
`pynacl` at run time without vendoring them. The Apple and Google attestation
root certificates embedded in the script are those manufacturers' published
public certificates, reproduced for pinning, with the URLs they came from in
the comments beside them.
